Package: iMetAct
Type: Package
Title: Calculate metabolic enzyme activity
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Binxian Wang
Maintainer: The package maintainer <binx24@sjtu.edu.cn>
Description: An integrated framework that infers metabolic enzyme activity
    from gene expression data by combining metabolic-transcription networks
    with an information propagation strategy. The package provides pre-built
    regulatory networks for 33 TCGA cancer types and supports custom
    network construction using Random Walk with Restart (RWR) and VIPER-based
    enrichment analysis.
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
Depends: R (>= 4.1.1)
Imports:
    igraph (>= 1.6.0),
    RANKS (>= 1.0),
    stats,
    utils,
    viper (>= 1.32.0)
Suggests:
    knitr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
